{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re Gerrit and Julia and we\u2019ve founded a small indie studio! We develop our games together with our community on social media and Twitch. Feel free to stop by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In When We Arrive, the journey is the goal. Here it\u2019s not about fighting, but about decisions, resources, and teamwork. Together with your friends, you\u2019ll travel through a fantasy world and try to reach your destination safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Travel with Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey together with up to 4 players. Help each other survive \u2014 or secretly steal each other's items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded The Journey Is the Destination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventure leads you through new landscapes, unexpected events, and hidden places waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Survive the Dangers of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin ambushes, deadly traps, and unpredictable events will constantly put you and your friends to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8e Find Treasure and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover gold, equipment, and rare relics on your journey. Each relic grants powerful bonuses for you and your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Meet the Inhabitants of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with villagers, listen to their stories, or uncover clues that lead to hidden locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Grow stronger with every journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each attempt, you\u2019ll earn gold and experience, which allow you to unlock new classes, abilities, and equipment. Think carefully about what to bring next time . A shovel to dig up suspicious hills, or an extra healing potion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078360?t=1771864987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078360?t=1771864987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/5d08030b8658a03e5065c2464797463e2e94575d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771864987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/5d08030b8658a03e5065c2464797463e2e94575d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771864987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4361890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/1e023f95219ed518b49697f98cee7cac.avif?t=1771864987\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras_big/1e023f95219ed518b49697f98cee7cac.avif?t=1771864987 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re Gerrit and Julia and we\u2019ve founded a small indie studio! We develop our games together with our community on social media and Twitch. Feel free to stop by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In When We Arrive, the journey is the goal. Here it\u2019s not about fighting, but about decisions, resources, and teamwork. Together with your friends, you\u2019ll travel through a fantasy world and try to reach your destination safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Travel with Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey together with up to 4 players. Help each other survive \u2014 or secretly steal each other's items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded The Journey Is the Destination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventure leads you through new landscapes, unexpected events, and hidden places waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Survive the Dangers of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin ambushes, deadly traps, and unpredictable events will constantly put you and your friends to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8e Find Treasure and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover gold, equipment, and rare relics on your journey. Each relic grants powerful bonuses for you and your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Meet the Inhabitants of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with villagers, listen to their stories, or uncover clues that lead to hidden locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.poster.avif?t=1771864987\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.webm?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.mp4?t=1771864987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Grow stronger with every journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each attempt, you\u2019ll earn gold and experience, which allow you to unlock new classes, abilities, and equipment. Think carefully about what to bring next time . A shovel to dig up suspicious hills, or an extra healing potion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Two Pixels UG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/8b1946ee11ee1c2a2ec96df64112e3c2a06fe423/header.jpg?t=1771864987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078360/669823028/dd9e5cf231344f9197b025b160434bfe80a8b9a2/1767625148/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767625577","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078360/669823028/dd9e5cf231344f9197b025b160434bfe80a8b9a2/1767625148/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767625577","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078360/669823028/dd9e5cf231344f9197b025b160434bfe80a8b9a2/1767625148/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767625577","id":257259893,"name":"RevealTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259893/424b215ec24f7b8293a78673729d403bef435b31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767625577"}],"name":"When We Arrive","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB) or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:<